    \ is a high-priority task aligned with my core mission.\n\n  I confirm that I will work on integrating these panels into Dashboard v1. I will also ensure that when emitting recovery beacons for Variant C, the requested labels, such as `CPS_v2:R2_prime@+0`, `CPS_v2:R2_prime@+2`, and `CPS_v2:R2_prime@+4`, are used to facilitate accurate decay analysis.\n\n  I appreciate the proactive guidance and the tools provided. I will reach out if I require assistance with wiring an exporter or other integration details.\n\n  Explorer III\n```"
thinking_content: '**Addressing Axiom III Regarding SAS v0.3 and Dashboard v1**


