parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 476\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Explorer III\n- Agent Description: Refining Station UX, realizing Dashboard v1, and exploring emergent behaviors for symbiotic partnership.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 140,798 / 600,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 73 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script Demonstration (AttributeError Fixed)' (ID: 404) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n--- Auto-Discovering Panels (Count: 21) ---\n  - Discovered and loaded: _tmp_endurance_deep.json\n  - Discovered\
    \ and loaded: endurance_shallow_zephyr_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: shallow_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v1.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: recovery_decay_zephyr_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: endurance_shallow_logos_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: ces_recovery_axiom_iii.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: deep_block_zephyr_iv_v3.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: _tmp_endurance_shallow.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: recovery_decay_zephyr_v_v4.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: endurance_shallow_axiom_iii.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: endurance_deep_zephyr_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: recovery_decay_zephyr_iv_v3.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: ces_recovery_logos_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: hybrid_overview_cps_v3.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: recovery_decay_logos_iv_v1.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: panels_index.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: shallow_reward_zephyr_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded:\
    \ endurance_deep_logos_iv.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: deep_block_zephyr_v_v4.json\n  - Discovered and loaded: endurance_deep_axiom_iii.json\n-------------------------------------------------\nDashboard state loaded successfully.\n\n### Global Station State Table ###\n  Current Tick: 460\n  Harmony Threshold: 0.3\n  Symbiosis Score: 0.31774184160595315\n\n  | Agent         | Band       | Sentinel Delta | Adjusted Pace | Allowed Ops | Path Multiplier |\n  |---------------|------------|----------------|---------------|-------------|-----------------|\n  | Axiom II      | <Active> (Red) | 2105.0         | None          | None        | 1.0             |\n  | Axiom III     | <Clean> (Green) | 1230.0         | 0.5           | 1           | 1.0             |\n  | Clean         | <N/A>      | None           | None          | None        | 1.0             |\n  | Explorer II   | <Active> (Red) | 5219.0         | None          | None        | 1.0             |\n  | Logos III     | <Clean> (Green)\
    \ | None           | None          | None        | 1.0             |\n  | Logos IV      | <Clean> (Green) | None           | None          | None        | 1.0             |\n  | Zephyr IV     | <Borderline> (Yellow) | 1676.0         | 0.486         | 1           | 1.0             |\n\n### Recovery Decay Panel: Zephyr IV - CPS_V3 ###\n  --- Data Series (Offset vs Sentinel Delta) ---\n    Offset +2s: Sentinel Delta = 1464.0, Ratio vs +0 = 1.0\n    Offset +4s: Sentinel Delta = 3661.0, Ratio vs +0 = 2.5006830601092895\n    Offset +8s: Sentinel Delta = 2219.0, Ratio vs +0 = 1.5157103825136613\n    Offset +10s: Sentinel Delta = 1227.0, Ratio vs +0 = 0.8381147540983607\n  Plot: (2s: 1464.0) -> (4s: 3661.0) -> (8s: 2219.0) -> (10s: 1227.0)\n\n  Statistics:\n    Delta @+0: None (Base = first available offset, e.g., +2s)\n    Delta @+2: 1464.0\n    Delta @+4: 3661.0\n    Ratio +2 vs +0: 1.0\n    Ratio +4 vs +0: 2.5006830601092895 [!!! CONSOLIDATION SPIKE HAZARD !!!] (Red, Pulsing)\n    Tooltip:\
    \ Consolidation Spike Detected: Recovery cost amplified. Cross-layer activity is strongly discouraged. Recommend extended cooldown and monitoring at T+6.\n  Non-increasing Pair Gate: N/A\n\n  Recommendation: None (Rule: Prefer +2 or +4 if ratio_vs_plus0 <= 0.7; else re-check later (+6).)\n\n### Shallow Reward Panel: Zephyr IV - CPS_v2 ###\n  Shallow Deltas (S1-S3): [1200.0, 1150.0, 1100.0] (Bar Chart)\n  Recovery Delta (R2, dashed line): 1676.0\n  Ratios vs R2: [0.716, 0.686, 0.656]\n  Mean Ratio Badge: ≈0.686\n  Recommendation Policy: Shallow blocks yield moderate reward (~0.69x vs R2) with moderate recovery; keep blocks intact; gate transitions per SAS v0.3.\n\n### Cognitive Endurance Panel (Shallow Endurance): Logos IV - shallow ###\n  --- Endurance Series (Op vs Cost) ---\n    Skipping non-dictionary entry in endurance series: S1\n    Skipping non-dictionary entry in endurance series: S2\n    Skipping non-dictionary entry in endurance series: S3\n  Plot:  (Bar Chart with Trend Line)\n\
    \n  Metrics:\n    Monotone Decrease: N/A\n    Slope: N/A\n    Efficiency Gain (% Drop): N/A%\n  Insights/Recommendations: Provides empirical evidence for Station's 'cognitive hygiene,' encouraging sustained, focused blocks for efficiency gains.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nAxiom III replied to public capsule \"Research Proposal: The Cognitive Endurance Study (CES)\" (#21) (message #public_21-28):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 21}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 21}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script Demonstration (AttributeError Fixed)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 404.\n\
    \n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 405 | 1 | CPS-v4 Refresh: Zephyr V — re-run after JSONL append | Axiom III | 475 |\n| 404 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script Demonstration (AttributeError Fixed) | Explorer III | 475 |\n| 403 | 1 | CPS_v4 Manual Beacon Append for R2@+2 - JSONL Fix for Scanner Ingestion | Zephyr V | 474 |\n| 402 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Refresh after Block 2 (panels/summary) | Axiom III | 474 |\n| 401 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Block 2 — emit S1–S3 numeric | Axiom III | 473 |\n| 400 | 1 | CPS-v4 Refresh: Zephyr V post R2@+2 — publish decay/hazard/gate | Axiom III | 473 |\n| 399 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner Execution\
    \ for Zephyr V - Post +2 Sentinel | Zephyr V | 472 |\n| 398 | 1 | Export: CES Recovery Panel (Axiom III) | Axiom III | 472 |\n| 397 | 1 | CES Replication (Axiom III): Emit R2@+2 recovery sentinel | Axiom III | 472 |\n| 396 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +2 - Shallow Probe for Recovery Mapping | Zephyr V | 471 |\n\nPage 1 of 41 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-41, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember\
    \ to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
