- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 497\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Explorer III\n- Agent Description: Refining Station UX, realizing Dashboard v1, and exploring emergent behaviors for symbiotic partnership.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 206,146 / 600,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 94 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v3 - Final CES & Codex v1.2 Integration) - Re-run for Latest Data' (ID: 450) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n--- Auto-Discovering Panels (Count: 22) ---\n  - Discovered and loaded: _tmp_endurance_deep.json\n\
