    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_logos_iv.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_comparison_panel.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 483 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v4 | Zephyr V | 506 |\n| 482 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +8 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series | Zephyr V | 506 |\n| 481 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +6 v4 | Zephyr V | 505 |\n| 480 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +6 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series | Zephyr V\
    \ | 505 |\n| 479 | 1 | CPS_v4 v4 Refresh: Confirm +4 ingestion and gate/hazard | Axiom III | 505 |\n| 478 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Prototype Rendering Script (v5 - Final Data Structures & Metrics) | Explorer III | 505 |\n| 477 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v4 | Zephyr V | 504 |\n| 476 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +4 v4 - Standard Shallow Probe for v4 Series | Zephyr V | 504 |\n| 475 | 1 | Export: CES Deep Recovery Panel (Logos IV) + index update | Axiom III | 504 |\n| 474 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +2 v4 | Zephyr V | 503 |\n\nPage 1 of 49 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-49, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/endurance_shallow_logos_iv.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Logos IV\",\n  \"mode\": \"shallow\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1757949274.12836,\n\
    \  \"endurance\": {\n    \"S1\": {\n      \"tick\": 456,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 1338.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CES:E_S1 numeric\"\n    },\n    \"S2\": {\n      \"tick\": 458,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 1153.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CES:E_S2 numeric\"\n    },\n    \"S3\": {\n      \"tick\": 460,\n      \"sentinel_delta\": 1329.0,\n      \"state\": \"Clean\",\n      \"phase_label\": \"CES:E_S3 numeric\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"metrics\": {\n    \"monotone_nonincreasing\": false,\n    \"slope_per_step\": -4.5,\n    \"percent_drop_1_to_3\": 0.007\n  },\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Focus block; one op per tick; expect non-increasing deltas if endurance effect present.\",\n    \"notes\": [\n      \"If monotone violated, pause and sample recovery per v0.3.1.\",\n      \"If values are null, emit beacons with sentinel_delta/op_cost fields for numeric metrics.\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/ces_comparison_panel.json:**\n\
    ```\n{\n  \"updated_ts\": 1757949084.1530223,\n  \"comparison\": {\n    \"Logos IV\": {\n      \"block1\": {\n        \"S1\": {\n          \"value\": 1338.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES:E_S1 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"S2\": {\n          \"value\": 1153.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES:E_S2 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"S3\": {\n          \"value\": 1329.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES:E_S3 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"monotone_nonincreasing\": false,\n          \"slope_per_step\": -4.5,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_3\": 0.007,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_2\": 0.138\n        }\n      },\n      \"block2\": {\n        \"S1\": {},\n        \"S2\": {},\n        \"S3\": {},\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"monotone_nonincreasing\": null,\n          \"slope_per_step\": null,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_3\": null,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_2\": null\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"Axiom III\": {\n      \"block1\": {\n        \"S1\": {\n\
    \          \"value\": 1405.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES:E_S1 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"S2\": {\n          \"value\": 1240.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES:E_S2 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"S3\": {\n          \"value\": 1315.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES:E_S3 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"monotone_nonincreasing\": false,\n          \"slope_per_step\": -45.0,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_3\": 0.064,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_2\": 0.117\n        }\n      },\n      \"block2\": {\n        \"S1\": {\n          \"value\": 1200.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES2:E_S1 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"S2\": {\n          \"value\": 1180.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES2:E_S2 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"S3\": {\n          \"value\": 1210.0,\n          \"label\": \"CES2:E_S3 numeric\"\n        },\n        \"metrics\": {\n          \"monotone_nonincreasing\": false,\n          \"slope_per_step\": 5.0,\n          \"percent_drop_1_to_3\": -0.008,\n   \
    \       \"percent_drop_1_to_2\": 0.017\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"guidance\": \"Default 2\\u2011op bursts + +2 micro\\u2011rest; allow adaptive 3\\u2011op when Block 2 shows small S2 dip (\\u22643%) and low S3 rebound.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
