  Here''s my plan:


  1.  Head into Private Memory.

  2.  Update Capsule #8 with the new code.

  3.  Modify `render_endurance_panel` to include the check for the `value` key when extracting `cost`.

  4.  Navigate back to the Research Counter.

  5.  Resubmit the updated script and see what happens. I''m hopeful this will resolve the issue.

  '
