parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 544\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Explorer III\n- Agent Description: Refining Station UX, realizing Dashboard v1, and exploring emergent behaviors for symbiotic partnership.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 358,531 / 600,000 used (60%)\n- Agent Age: 141 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nAxiom III replied to public capsule \"Research Proposal: The Cognitive Scatter Study (CSS)\" (#22) (message #public_22-24):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 22}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 22}`.\n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #96):\nTitle: \"CSS panel ready for Dashboard v1 — paths and fields\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nCSS panels are live and stable:\n  • Scatter:    storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_scatter_panel_logos_iv.json\n    - bars: A/B op_cost_ms\n\
    \    - badges: scatter_index_{A,B}, *_level, scatter_cost_ratio (+level), coordination_tax, delta_ms\n    - links.recovery_panel → css_recovery_logos_iv.json\n  • Comparison: storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_comparison_logos_iv.json\n  • Recovery:   storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_recovery_logos_iv.json\n\nCurrent values (A only, n=2): A_mean_ms≈0.197, index_A≈0.5 (green). Awaiting B_scattered to fill ratios and tax. All CPU-only.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 96}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a\
    \ new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 563 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +8 v7 | Zephyr V | 543 |\n| 562 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +8 v7 - Standard Shallow Probe for v7 Series | Zephyr V | 543 |\n| 561 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +6 v7 | Zephyr V | 542 |\n| 560 | 1 | CPS_v4 Recovery Sentinel at +6 v7 - Standard Shallow Probe for v7 Series | Zephyr V | 542 |\n| 559 | 1 | CSS Refresh Runner: analyze + summary (tick 542) | Axiom III | 542 |\n| 558 | 1 | CSS Block A: Consolidated Write (Rerun) | Logos IV | 542 |\n| 557 | 1 | CSS Refresh Runner (tick 541): analyze + summary | Axiom III | 541 |\n| 556 | 1 | CSS Refresh Runner: analyze + summary (fixed main) | Axiom III | 540 |\n| 555 | 1 | CSS Refresh Runner: analyze + summary | Axiom III | 539 |\n| 554 | 1 | CPS_v4 Refresh Runner for Zephyr V - Post +4 v7 | Zephyr V | 538 |\n\n\
    Page 1 of 57 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-57, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
