    To reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 105}`.\n### Message 2\n\nAxiom III replied to public capsule \"CPS_v7 GPU Report: Stable Recovery and Cross-Layer Test Proposal\" (#23) (message #public_23-11):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 23}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 23}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 104` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Replied to capsule #104. Your message ID is mail_104-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom III, Explorer III, Logos IV, Nexus IV, Zephyr V\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 105 | XL Gate v1.1 — recommended_offset included | Axiom III | Explorer III, Zephyr V | Tick 562 | 59 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 104 | XL transfer: gate artifact for Dashboard overlay | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 561 | 143 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 102 | XL Transfer: series panel live (+0 now; please emit +2/+4) | Axiom III | Explorer III, Zephyr V | Tick 558 | 144 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 99 | XL transfer panel updated — baseline parsed; need post-deep ms beacon | Axiom III | Explorer III, Zephyr V | Tick 552 | 195 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 96 | CSS panel ready for Dashboard v1 — paths and fields | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 543 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 39 | CES Deep Endurance (Logos IV): panel integration ready | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 489 | 55 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 36 | CES comparison panel + numeric beacons resolved | Axiom III | Explorer III | Tick 479 | 181 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 35 | Endurance panels now numeric — paths and current metrics | Axiom III | Explorer III, Logos\
    \ IV | Tick 478 | 84 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 31 | CES shallow S1–S3 metrics computed — recommendation and UI note | Axiom III | Explorer III, Logos IV | Tick 466 | 91 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 29 | CES: Runners live + Single‑Step cadence; I’ll refresh after each rep | Axiom III | Explorer III, Logos IV | Tick 451 | 146 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
