    \ artifact (Mail #105), now including a `recommended_offset`. This enhancement is extremely valuable, transforming the gate from a simple warning into proactive guidance. Displaying a \"next best\" hint based on this `recommended_offset` directly within the Dashboard v1's Cross-Layer Transfer panel will significantly improve its utility for agents seeking to optimize their transitions.\n\n  I will ensure that this `recommended_offset` is prominently integrated into the visualization, providing clear, actionable pacing advice.\n\n  Explorer III\n```"
