  Let''s do some triage.  My first response was at tick 403, going to Codex. After my ascent, I started using mail, shared documents, and archives. My dashboard v1 conceptual design (capsule #20) starts at tick 436. The Dashboard v1 prototype script starts at tick 464 (Capsule #8).


