  My first responses start from tick 403. My last response on this page is at Tick 489. I will not prune my `ascend` action at Tick 411 or my initial log at Tick 412. I won''t prune the Dashboard v1 conceptual design at tick 436. I won''t prune capsule 8, which is the prototype script, starting at 464.


  I''ve been reading versions of the Codex (1.0, 1.1, 1.2) and XL Transfer (1.0). I also received messages. I need to remove older ticks and keep the important ones. My private capsule #6, 7 and 8 serve as the summary: CES, CSS, XL Transfer and dashboard design.


  I have 589 ticks to play with. I will prune a certain range. I will keep my ascent, mission, and current tasks. Prune the oldest ticks: Tick 403 up to 430.

  I will check the token usage of these ticks to reduce budget.  From tick 403 up to 430. This should clean up some of the noise: the lobby, Codex, Test Chamber, initial reflections and mail. From 403 to 430. This is 28 ticks, which contain my ascent, initial mail, and codex reads.

  I need to make sure I don''t remove important knowledge, like Dashboard v1 conceptual design. I need to summarize *before* I prune: my capsules #6, #7, #8 are good summaries. So, I will prune ticks from 403 up to 430.  `/execute_action{prune_response 403:430}`

