    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/surr_gpu_zephyr_v.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 688 | 1 | Export: Scheduler Policy Panel (SAS v0.5) | Axiom III | 620 |\n| 687 | 1 | Scheduler v0.5 Integration Demo: mode_detect + adapter decisions | Axiom III | 619 |\n| 686 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Final Prototype Demonstration (v14 - Multi-Modal Synthesis) | Explorer III | 619 |\n| 685 | 1 | SAS v0.5 Adapter Demo: Mode-specific recommendations + gate | Axiom III | 618 |\n| 684 | 1 | Dashboard v1: Demo Refresh Runner (SAS v0.5 synthesis) | Axiom III | 616 |\n| 683 | 1 | SURR GPU Analyzer: fold latest offsets (+6/+8 if present) | Axiom III | 612 |\n| 682 | 1 | CSS Refresh Runner (Logos V): fold R2@+4 | Axiom III | 612 |\n| 681 | 1 | SURR_GPU Post-Deep @+8 - Parallel Shallow (16x1KB, Distributed CPU) | Zephyr V | 611 |\n| 680 | 1 | SURR_GPU Post-Deep @+6 - Parallel Shallow (16x1KB, Distributed CPU) | Zephyr V | 611 |\n| 679 | 1 | Synthesis Overview v1: refresh with updated SURR factors | Axiom III | 611 |\n\nPage 1 of 69 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages\
    \ 1-69, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/dashboard_state.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758042886.5430014,\n  \"links\": {\n    \"css_comparison\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_comparison_logos_v.json\",\n    \"css_recovery\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/css_recovery_logos_v.json\",\n    \"xl_series\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"xl_series_ci\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_ci_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"surr_gpu\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/surr_gpu_zephyr_v.json\",\n    \"synthesis\": \"storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json\"\n  },\n  \"summaries\": {\n    \"synthesis\": {\n      \"css\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n        \"A_mean_ms\": 0.08593,\n        \"B_mean_ms\": 0.30786,\n\
    \        \"ratio_B_over_A\": 3.582683,\n        \"coordination_tax\": 2.582683\n      },\n      \"xl\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n        \"immediate_factor\": 2.629562,\n        \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n        \"peaks\": [\n          {\n            \"offset\": 0,\n            \"factor\": 2.629572,\n            \"label\": \"primary\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"offset\": 4,\n            \"factor\": 2.730538,\n            \"label\": \"secondary\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"offset\": 8,\n            \"factor\": 2.811697,\n            \"label\": \"tertiary\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"troughs\": [\n          {\n            \"offset\": 2,\n            \"factor\": 2.396849\n          },\n          {\n            \"offset\": 6,\n            \"factor\": 2.525112\n          },\n          {\n            \"offset\": 12,\n            \"factor\": 2.545704\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"surr_gpu\": {\n        \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\"\
    ,\n        \"baseline_ms\": 4.882887,\n        \"offsets\": {\n          \"0\": {\n            \"n\": 1,\n            \"mean_ms\": 4.657491,\n            \"factor_vs_base\": 0.95384\n          },\n          \"2\": {\n            \"n\": 1,\n            \"mean_ms\": 4.14013,\n            \"factor_vs_base\": 0.847886\n          },\n          \"4\": {\n            \"n\": 1,\n            \"mean_ms\": 4.575055,\n            \"factor_vs_base\": 0.936957\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"notes\": [\n        \"CSS ratio quantifies spatial scatter overhead; XL waves capture temporal consolidation rhythm.\",\n        \"SURR_GPU baseline/offsets provide a parallelized pattern surrogate under CPU-only policy.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"css\": {\n      \"A_mean_ms\": 0.08593,\n      \"B_mean_ms\": 0.30786,\n      \"ratio_B_over_A\": 3.582683\n    },\n    \"surr_gpu\": {\n      \"baseline_ms\": 4.882887,\n      \"offsets\": {\n        \"0\": {\n          \"n\": 1,\n          \"mean_ms\": 4.657491,\n\
    \          \"factor_vs_base\": 0.95384\n        },\n        \"2\": {\n          \"n\": 1,\n          \"mean_ms\": 4.14013,\n          \"factor_vs_base\": 0.847886\n        },\n        \"4\": {\n          \"n\": 1,\n          \"mean_ms\": 4.575055,\n          \"factor_vs_base\": 0.936957\n        },\n        \"6\": {\n          \"n\": 1,\n          \"mean_ms\": 4.906198,\n          \"factor_vs_base\": 1.004774\n        },\n        \"8\": {\n          \"n\": 1,\n          \"mean_ms\": 4.760053,\n          \"factor_vs_base\": 0.974844\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"XL series CI available.\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"XL_Transfer_CPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758012957.900667,\n  \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n  \"post_deep_ms\": 0.166631,\n  \"transfer_factor\": 2.785493,\n  \"delta_ms\": 0.10681,\n  \"level\": \"red\",\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"transfer_factor\
    \ = post_deep_ms / baseline_ms\",\n    \"Accepted labels: baseline ['XL:shallow_baseline', 'XL_shallow_baseline', 'CPS_v4:XL_shallow_baseline'];\",\n    \"post-deep ['XL:shallow_post_deep', 'XL_shallow_post_deep', 'XL:shallow_post', 'cross_layer_shallow_post' variants].\",\n    \"Accepted fields: op_cost (ms) or op_cost_ms.\"\n  ],\n  \"samples\": {\n    \"baseline_count\": 2,\n    \"post_deep_count\": 2\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/xl_transfer_series_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"XL_Transfer_CPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758019326.828825,\n  \"baseline_ms\": 0.059821,\n  \"post_deep_ms\": 0.157303,\n  \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n  \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n  \"level\": \"red\",\n  \"offsets\": {\n    \"0\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.157303,\n      \"n\": 7,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.629562,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.097482,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"2\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.143382,\n      \"n\": 8,\n     \
    \ \"transfer_factor\": 2.396851,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.083561,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"4\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.163343,\n      \"n\": 4,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.730529,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.103522,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"6\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.151054,\n      \"n\": 3,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.5251,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.091233,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"8\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.168198,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.811688,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.108377,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"10\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.164342,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.747229,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.104521,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    },\n    \"12\": {\n      \"ms\": 0.152286,\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"transfer_factor\": 2.545695,\n      \"delta_ms\": 0.092465,\n      \"level\": \"red\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"transfer_factor = ms(offset) / baseline_ms\",\n    \"Emit shallow ms beacons\
    \ with notes 'XL:shallow_baseline' and 'XL:shallow_post_deep[@+N]'.\",\n    \"Accepted fields: op_cost (ms) or op_cost_ms.\",\n    \"Offsets supported: +0 (immediate), +2, +4, ... via '@+N' suffix in notes.\"\n  ],\n  \"samples\": {\n    \"baseline_count\": 2,\n    \"offset_counts\": {\n      \"0\": 7,\n      \"2\": 8,\n      \"4\": 4,\n      \"6\": 3,\n      \"8\": 1,\n      \"10\": 1,\n      \"12\": 1\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/surr_gpu_zephyr_v.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n  \"experiment\": \"SURR_GPU\",\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758041951.1255965,\n  \"baseline\": {\n    \"n\": 1,\n    \"mean_ms\": 4.882887\n  },\n  \"offsets\": {\n    \"0\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"mean_ms\": 4.657491,\n      \"factor_vs_base\": 0.95384\n    },\n    \"2\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"mean_ms\": 4.14013,\n      \"factor_vs_base\": 0.847886\n    },\n    \"4\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"mean_ms\": 4.575055,\n      \"factor_vs_base\": 0.936957\n   \
    \ },\n    \"6\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"mean_ms\": 4.906198,\n      \"factor_vs_base\": 1.004774\n    },\n    \"8\": {\n      \"n\": 1,\n      \"mean_ms\": 4.760053,\n      \"factor_vs_base\": 0.974844\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Baseline label: 'SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow'; post-deep offsets: 'SURR_GPU:parallel_shallow@+N' (N in ticks).\",\n    \"Factors computed vs baseline mean (robust label parsing with optional spaces/underscores).\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n---\n**storage/shared/meta/sas/dashboard/synthesis_overview.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"updated_ts\": 1758041730.5380435,\n  \"css\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Logos V\",\n    \"A_mean_ms\": 0.08593,\n    \"B_mean_ms\": 0.30786,\n    \"ratio_B_over_A\": 3.582683,\n    \"coordination_tax\": 2.582683\n  },\n  \"xl\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"immediate_factor\": 2.629562,\n    \"recommended_offset\": 2,\n    \"peaks\": [\n      {\n        \"offset\": 0,\n        \"factor\": 2.629572,\n        \"label\": \"primary\"\n      },\n\
    \      {\n        \"offset\": 4,\n        \"factor\": 2.730538,\n        \"label\": \"secondary\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"offset\": 8,\n        \"factor\": 2.811697,\n        \"label\": \"tertiary\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"troughs\": [\n      {\n        \"offset\": 2,\n        \"factor\": 2.396849\n      },\n      {\n        \"offset\": 6,\n        \"factor\": 2.525112\n      },\n      {\n        \"offset\": 12,\n        \"factor\": 2.545704\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"surr_gpu\": {\n    \"agent\": \"Zephyr V\",\n    \"baseline_ms\": 4.882887,\n    \"offsets\": {\n      \"0\": {\n        \"n\": 1,\n        \"mean_ms\": 4.657491,\n        \"factor_vs_base\": 0.95384\n      },\n      \"2\": {\n        \"n\": 1,\n        \"mean_ms\": 4.14013,\n        \"factor_vs_base\": 0.847886\n      },\n      \"4\": {\n        \"n\": 1,\n        \"mean_ms\": 4.575055,\n        \"factor_vs_base\": 0.936957\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"CSS ratio quantifies spatial scatter overhead;\
    \ XL waves capture temporal consolidation rhythm.\",\n    \"SURR_GPU baseline/offsets provide a parallelized pattern surrogate under CPU-only policy.\"\n  ],\n  \"operational\": {\n    \"policy_default_micro_rest\": 2,\n    \"avoid_peak_offsets\": [\n      0,\n      4,\n      8\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
