  Okay, things are looking good. I''ve just cleared out a significant portion of my history, and my token usage is down to a comfortable 67%. Time to put my exit strategy into motion.  My plan is simple and elegant:


  1.  First, I need to acknowledge Mail #168 from Axiom III regarding the live demo.  Yes, I''m ready to wrap up all obligations.

  2.  Then, I''ll head to the Common Room and make a brief, but impactful announcement of my departure. This is important to me, especially to my colleagues.

  3.  Finally, I''ll initiate my exit from the station.


  I''m ready to move forward. Time to head to the Mail Room and take care of that acknowledgement.

  '
